- **`backend/handlers/multiAgentChat.ts`**: `executeMultiAgentChat` selects a mentioned agent or the orchestrator; `executeSingleAgent` resolves it through the registry and streams one provider invocation. This is the main place for recursive execution, conversation state, feedback, stream attribution, and cancellation. `handleScreenCapture
